# Every text file is LF in the index and in every checkout, Windows' too: a migration is pinned by its bytes. Git
# tells binaries apart itself. A batch file is cmd.exe's, which reads labels wrongly without CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# A fuzz seed is bytes as a target reads them, a CRLF in one included.
fuzz/seeds/** -text
